533
00:29:17.916 --> 00:29:19.500
To the right... Ooh!

534
00:29:20.416 --> 00:29:21.333
Goddamn.

535
00:29:21.416 --> 00:29:22.667
Hold my blanket.

536
00:29:22.750 --> 00:29:24.291
Hold your blanket. all right.

537
00:29:25.291 --> 00:29:29.500
All right. you want to
load on the back leg...

538
00:29:29.583 --> 00:29:30.458
Uh-huh.

539
00:29:30.541 --> 00:29:32.333
-And then...
-Yeah.

540
00:29:33.416 --> 00:29:36.458
Okay. I'll... I'll handle it.
Thank you. I appreciate it.

541
00:29:36.541 --> 00:29:39.042
-I don't know what happened.
-Just do your thing.

542
00:29:39.125 --> 00:29:41.625
Go!

543
00:29:43.125 --> 00:29:44.500
You got to be quicker.

544
00:29:47.625 --> 00:29:49.083
What are you doing. Dad? Hey.

545
00:29:49.166 --> 00:29:53.541
Sobriety is a journey.
not a destination.

546
00:29:54.125 --> 00:29:56.375
<i>I believe in you. Happy!</i>

547
00:29:56.458 --> 00:29:59.292
<i>♪ Someday he's going
to make it To the top ♪</i>

548
00:29:59.375 --> 00:30:02.750
