554
00:30:25.625 --> 00:30:28.208
Oh. there he goes.

555
00:30:29.083 --> 00:30:32.041
Nice even strokes.
Thank you. Charlotte.

556
00:30:33.333 --> 00:30:36.000
Good. Finish the louvers.
then do the borders.

557
00:30:36.083 --> 00:30:36.917
Yes. sir.

558
00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:39.875
Ladies and gentlemen. please
