595
00:33:00.875 --> 00:33:03.542
What are you talking about?
You're all something.

596
00:33:03.625 --> 00:33:07.167
Something to me. Get
in here. Love you guys.

597
00:33:07.250 --> 00:33:10.750
This is the first time you're gonna
be far away from us since Mom left.

598
00:33:10.833 --> 00:33:13.250
We can FaceTime Dad
every day. It'll be okay.

599
00:33:13.333 --> 00:33:15.542
-Yeah. day or night. You hear me?
-Yeah.

600
00:33:15.625 --> 00:33:18.750
And I'll be back Sunday to
