doesn't sleep in my bed.

604
00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:26.375
If he does. no M&M's. Okay?

605
00:33:26.458 --> 00:33:27.458
-Got it.
-Got it.

606
00:33:31.916 --> 00:33:33.291
{\an8}Arnold.

607
00:33:34.208 --> 00:33:35.458
{\an8}Jack-o.

608
00:33:36.791 --> 00:33:37.833
{\an8}Tiger.

609
00:33:39.416 --> 00:33:40.416
SpongeBob?

610
00:33:41.291 --> 00:33:42.500
{\an8}What is that?

611
00:33:42.583 --> 00:33:44.708
What's with the beaver teeth?

612
00:33:44.791 --> 00:33:46.458
The truth can hurt sometimes.

613
00:33:46.541 --> 00:33:49.958
-Oh. my goodness. Dougie boy!
-Happy!

614
00:33:50.041 --> 00:33:53.708
I missed you. bro. How's
everything been going?

615
00:33:53.791 --> 00:33:56.042
Oh. it gets harder
every year. Happy.

616
00:33:56.125 --> 00:33:58.292
How's it getting
harder? I'm not around.

617
00:33:58.375 --> 00:34:00.667
Yeah. honestly. the
Maxi Golf League.

618
00:34:00.750 --> 00:34:03.667
The Maxi... I saw a commercial
for that. It looked stupid.

619
00:34:03.750 --> 00:34:07.125
-Well. supposedly. it is faster-paced...
-Yeah. yeah.

620
00:34:07.208 --> 00:34:10.417
...and our biggest sponsors are
suddenly slow to call me back.

621
00:34:10.500 --> 00:34:12.417
I got a bad feeling about this.

622
00:34:12.500 --> 00:34:16.417
We got the greatest golfers in the world.
That's what people want to see. the best.

623
00:34:16.500 --> 00:34:18.458
Manatee says his
guys are better.

624
00:34:18.541 --> 00:34:20.250
There's only one
way to find out.

625
00:34:20.333 --> 00:34:22.458
Challenge him. People
would love to watch that.

626
00:34:22.541 --> 00:34:25.958
Wow! Virginia really
rubbed off on you.

627
00:34:26.041 --> 00:34:27.375
We had five kids together.

628
00:34:27.458 --> 00:34:28.917
She rubbed off on
me all the time.

629
00:34:29.000 --> 00:34:31.250
and I just laid there
like a sack of potatoes.

630
00:34:31.333 --> 00:34:34.625
As charming as ever.
Hey. just get inside.

631
00:34:34.708 --> 00:34:36.333
The guys are excited to see you.

632
00:34:36.416 --> 00:34:40.583
Would you at least get Invisalign
for that thing? Thank you.

633
00:34:41.500 --> 00:34:44.500
Hey. Happy. you gonna finish
off that blueberry jubilee?

634
00:34:44.583 --> 00:34:48.375
Oh. God. Freddy's still snaking
everybody's dessert? Okay. you got it.

635
00:34:48.458 --> 00:34:49.875
Thank you. Cheers.

636
00:34:49.958 --> 00:34:52.667
I'm so happy to be with you. Look
forward to getting out there.

637
00:34:52.750 --> 00:34:54.417
