639
00:34:56.041 --> 00:34:58.208
Happy. these kids
are 20. 30 years old.

640
00:34:58.291 --> 00:34:59.417
We're old and stiff.

641
00:34:59.500 --> 00:35:01.250
We're old. but we're still cool.

642
00:35:01.333 --> 00:35:04.000
You guys taking aspirin
before you get out there?

643
00:35:04.083 --> 00:35:05.708
I'm popping them like Tic Tacs.

644
00:35:05.791 --> 00:35:08.000
I grind them in my applesauce.

645
00:35:08.083 --> 00:35:10.500
