to this ballet school in Paris. so...

655
00:35:34.416 --> 00:35:36.708
Happy. I've known
you for 30 years.

656
00:35:36.791 --> 00:35:38.917
You're like a son to
me. How much you need?

657
00:35:39.000 --> 00:35:40.167
300 grand.

658
00:35:40.250 --> 00:35:42.458
Good luck tomorrow.
Hit 'em straight.

659
00:35:43.166 --> 00:35:44.625
