674
00:36:35.750 --> 00:36:39.083
Excuse me? Gentleman would
like new gin and tonic.

675
00:36:39.166 --> 00:36:42.375
He said Bombay. no Tanqueray.

676
00:36:42.458 --> 00:36:44.542
You told Spiethy
that was on me. man?

677
00:36:44.625 --> 00:36:45.750
No. no.

678
00:36:45.833 --> 00:36:48.542
You threw me under the bus.
So you could be the hero?

679
00:36:48.625 --> 00:36:49.542
No. I... No.

680
00:36:49.625 --> 00:36:52.417
You stabbed me in my back.
That's what time it is?

681
00:36:52.500 --> 00:36:53.625
He just. he just said...

682
00:36:53.708 --> 00:36:57.083
I can't work like this. man.
Watching my six all day. every day.

683
00:36:57.166 --> 00:36:59.208
I just wanted to
help. I offered bread.

684
00:36:59.291 --> 00:37:00.875
You mess around. you find out.

685
