688
00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:13.083
Sorry you had to hear
that. Mr. Gilmore.

689
00:37:14.041 --> 00:37:17.542
You don't know the backstory.
Mr. Couples? More blueberry jubilee?

690
00:37:17.625 --> 00:37:20.208
Nah. I'm okay. Maybe one more.

691
00:37:20.291 --> 00:37:22.333
Yeah. Back in two.

692
00:37:25.666 --> 00:37:27.791
Yackety-yack. don't come back.

693
00:37:29.666 --> 00:37:30.666
Whoo!

694
00:37:31.916 --> 00:37:33.250
Ah!

695
00:37:39.708 --> 00:37:44.708
Shooter McGavin. I'm
such a massive fan.

696
00:37:45.833 --> 00:37:50.500
Gentlemen. thank you for being
here at the Tour Champions Dinner.

697
00:37:51.458 --> 00:37:52.583
That's what she said.

698
00:37:55.750 --> 00:37:56.958
I'm not sure that made sense. X.

699
00:37:57.041 --> 00:38:01.667
Every time our sport has overcome a
challenge. we have come out stronger.

700
00:38:01.750 --> 00:38:04.750
Today's challenge is
the Maxi Golf League.

701
