702
00:38:08.458 --> 00:38:09.791
That's what she said.

703
00:38:12.458 --> 00:38:14.542
-Great joke. Mr. Schauffele.
-Thanks. buddy.

704
00:38:14.625 --> 00:38:16.750
I just got off the
phone with the president

705
