-So how about this?

715
00:38:47.791 --> 00:38:51.708
Top five finishers this weekend
represent us in the challenge.

716
00:38:51.791 --> 00:38:53.583
All right. Let's go.

717
00:38:54.625 --> 00:38:56.375
That's what she said.

718
00:38:57.125 --> 00:39:00.042
Gentlemen. by showing
the world our dominance.

719
00:39:00.125 --> 00:39:04.500
we will eliminate this league
before it even officially launches.

720
00:39:04.583 --> 00:39:06.750
Let's go!

721
00:39:09.666 --> 00:39:12.291
And now you've got something
else to play for. Happy.

722
00:39:14.208 --> 00:39:17.666
Yeah! Yeah!

723
00:39:19.458 --> 00:39:23.375
Gosh. I think there's
a fork in my ass.

724
00:39:23.458 --> 00:39:25.083
Now that's what she said.

725
00:39:26.416 --> 00:39:28.708
Yeah!

726
00:39:36.083 --> 00:39:38.542
<i>The sun is shining. The
greens are shimmering.</i>

727
00:39:38.625 --> 00:39:40.500
{\an8}<i>What a day to play some golf.</i>

728
00:39:40.583 --> 00:39:44.833
<i>Welcome to the big one. the
U.S. Bank Tour Championship.</i>

729
00:39:44.916 --> 00:39:48.542
{\an8}I'm Verne Lundquist. Here.
as always. with Jack Beard.

730
00:39:48.625 --> 00:39:52.333
{\an8}And the golfer everyone is
talking about. Happy Gilmore.

731
00:39:52.416 --> 00:39:53.542
-Looks handsome.
-Yeah.

732
00:39:53.625 --> 00:39:57.167
{\an8}<i>Gilmore returns after
a ten-year absence.</i>

733
00:39:57.250 --> 00:39:59.083
{\an8}<i>Some of the guys
set your locker up.</i>

734
00:40:01.291 --> 00:40:05.250
{\an8}Bengay. Tums.
Preparation H. yeah.

735
00:40:05.333 --> 00:40:06.750
MiraLAX. always good.

736
00:40:06.833 --> 00:40:10.750
{\an8}And. uh. diapers. Now
that's pushing it.

737
00:40:16.458 --> 00:40:18.208
I know you never made
it to the Bruins. Happy.

738
00:40:18.291 --> 00:40:20.292
but maybe you'll make this
five-man wrecking crew.

739
00:40:20.375 --> 00:40:25.125
Oh. I doubt that. Tony. I'm actually
just worried about making the cut.

740
00:40:25.208 --> 00:40:26.708
Mr. Gilmore. Sergio told me

741
00:40:26.791 --> 00:40:30.333
you forgot to bring a caddie to
your first tournament. Is that true?

742
00:40:30.416 --> 00:40:32.333
He said that? No.

743
00:40:32.416 --> 00:40:35.625
Well. yeah. but still. I didn't
know the rules back then.

744
00:40:35.708 --> 00:40:37.083
That's insane.

745
00:40:37.166 --> 00:40:40.625
Yeah. that was silly. Can't
believe I would do that.

746
00:40:48.250 --> 00:40:52.333
Hey. brother. Good to see you.
man. So here's what happened.

747
00:40:52.416 --> 00:40:56.167
My regular caddie moved to
Switzerland for tax purposes.

748
00:40:56.250 --> 00:40:58.500
so I'm kind of like.
I got nowhere to go.

749
00:40:58.583 --> 00:41:01.417
What do you say. you and
me for old times' sake?

750
00:41:01.500 --> 00:41:03.167
That's nice. Mr. Gilmore.

751
00:41:03.250 --> 00:41:06.417
but I. unfortunately. I
can't caddie for you today.

752
00:41:06.500 --> 00:41:09.958
You're not still mad about the
whole choking you thing. are you?

753
00:41:10.041 --> 00:41:11.542
No. it's not that.

754
00:41:11.625 --> 00:41:13.958
It's actually. I
don't caddie anymore.

755
00:41:14.041 --> 00:41:17.208
I. uh... I play now. We're
actually playing together today.

756
00:41:17.291 --> 00:41:20.750
I didn't know that. Blondie. All
right. well. I'll see you out there.

757
00:41:20.833 --> 00:41:21.833
I'll see ya.

758
00:41:23.291 --> 00:41:24.791
Blondie.

759
00:41:25.416 --> 00:41:29.917
My name's Will. and I'm still mad at you
for choking me out. you son of a bitch.

760
00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:32.625
<i>We're minutes away
from the start.</i>

761
00:41:32.708 --> 00:41:37.292
<i>and Happy Gilmore is apparently
breaking in yet another new caddie.</i>

762
00:41:37.375 --> 00:41:39.083
Uh. it's a club. Yeah.

763
00:41:39.166 --> 00:41:41.167
Club. Oh. like
the club sandwich.

764
00:41:41.250 --> 00:41:42.750
Not the club sandwich. Okay.

765
00:41:42.833 --> 00:41:45.333
<i>Let's check in with
our own Gary Potter.</i>

766
00:41:45.416 --> 00:41:48.250
{\an8}who's with number one-ranked
Scottie Scheffler.

767
00:41:48.333 --> 00:41:49.250
{\an8}<i>Thanks. Verne.</i>

768
00:41:49.333 --> 00:41:51.333
{\an8}<i>Scottie. you have
been on quite a tear.</i>

769
00:41:51.416 --> 00:41:53.583
{\an8}<i>My God. You're seeing
the ball and the hole.</i>

770
00:41:53.666 --> 00:41:56.583
{\an8}<i>and the position of the ball
and the hole... all good things.</i>

771
00:41:56.666 --> 00:41:58.625
{\an8}<i>Is there a question
in there. Gary?</i>

772
00:41:58.708 --> 00:42:02.166
{\an8}<i>Scottie. if you're the best. does
that make everyone else the worst?</i>

773
00:42:03.125 --> 00:42:04.375
{\an8}<i>I'm just gonna go warm up.</i>

774
00:42:04.458 --> 00:42:07.875
{\an8}<i>Always great catching up with
Scottie. Back to you. Verne.</i>

775
00:42:07.958 --> 00:42:09.500
Thanks. Gary.

776
00:42:10.583 --> 00:42:14.750
{\an8}The threesome of Justin
Thomas. Will Zalatoris.

777
00:42:14.833 --> 00:42:18.416
<i>and Happy Gilmore
is about to tee off.</i>

778
00:42:20.916 --> 00:42:23.416
Ooh.

779
00:42:26.083 --> 00:42:27.833
Nice. Nice bang. JT.

780
00:42:27.916 --> 00:42:29.625
Pressure's on with
Happy watching.

781
00:42:29.708 --> 00:42:31.042
My family loves you.

782
00:42:31.125 --> 00:42:33.083
I'm actually rooting
for you. I gotta stop.

783
00:42:33.166 --> 00:42:35.625
No. Keep it coming. I need
all the love I can get.

784
00:42:35.708 --> 00:42:36.542
Gotcha.

785
00:42:36.625 --> 00:42:38.958
Now on the tee. Zalatoris. Will.

786
00:42:40.833 --> 00:42:43.083
That's your name?

787
00:42:43.666 --> 00:42:46.000
"That's your name?"
What an idiot.

788
00:42:46.083 --> 00:42:49.917
I'm a little intimidated. All these
guys hit it big now. you know?

789
00:42:50.000 --> 00:42:52.417
Do you need a water
refill? Any bread sticks?

790
00:42:52.500 --> 00:42:55.666
No. Maybe I'll go
to my happy place.

791
00:42:56.791 --> 00:42:58.416
Okay. I will be here.

792
00:43:04.958 --> 00:43:07.541
It's not working. I
don't drink beer anymore.

793
00:43:08.625 --> 00:43:09.708
Good.

794
00:43:09.791 --> 00:43:12.667
Now on the tee. Gilmore. Happy.

795
00:43:12.750 --> 00:43:14.417
Welcome back. Happy!

796
00:43:14.500 --> 00:43:18.667
<i>Golf fans around the world are
excited to see Happy Gilmore again.</i>

797
00:43:18.750 --> 00:43:20.458
<i>but at 58 years old.</i>

798
00:43:20.541 --> 00:43:25.292
<i>I'm not sure even Gilmore thinks
he can compete with today's best.</i>

799
00:43:25.375 --> 00:43:26.250
Hey. Happy!

800
00:43:26.333 --> 00:43:28.333
I guess I need to
update my happy place

801
00:43:28.416 --> 00:43:31.750
to something a little
more age appropriate.

802
00:43:33.875 --> 00:43:36.375
Whoa!

803
00:43:48.208 --> 00:43:51.166
You can do it!

804
00:44:01.041 --> 00:44:02.708
Yeah.

805
00:44:27.583 --> 00:44:28.708
Okay.

806
00:44:29.375 --> 00:44:31.708
<i>Thank you. Happy!

807
00:44:31.791 --> 00:44:34.500
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

808
00:44:35.458 --> 00:44:37.500
Never did that before.
Thank you. man.

809
00:44:37.583 --> 00:44:40.250
Okay. well. let's get... All
right. we're going to go.

810
00:44:40.333 --> 00:44:42.833
-But you bring those. Those always come.
-Oh.

811
00:44:43.625 --> 00:44:45.542
All right? That's it. that's it.

812
00:44:45.625 --> 00:44:46.500
I'm sorry.

813
00:44:46.583 --> 00:44:49.250
No. no. They got a strap if
you want to use the strap.

814
00:45:01.916 --> 00:45:05.250
A snake! Get it off
me. god damn it!

815
00:45:05.333 --> 00:45:07.041
Get the snake!

816
00:45:09.000 --> 00:45:10.916
Come on. Come on. Come on.

817
00:45:11.583 --> 00:45:15.750
Goal! Yeah. baby!

818
00:45:18.625 --> 00:45:20.917
Come on. Happy!

819
00:45:21.000 --> 00:45:22.666
<i>Man. I don't drink.</i>

820
00:45:23.666 --> 00:45:24.917
How about some coffee?

821
00:45:25.000 --> 00:45:28.167
That I can do! Let's
go. Let's go. Let's go.

822
00:45:28.250 --> 00:45:31.375
Chug. chug. chug!

823
00:45:33.500 --> 00:45:36.041
Yeah!

824
00:45:37.541 --> 00:45:40.541
Yeah! Let's go! Yeah!

825
00:45:47.125 --> 00:45:49.583
Holy shit!

826
00:46:02.666 --> 00:46:04.167
Still the man. Happy!

827
00:46:04.250 --> 00:46:06.500
It's my kids. Sorry. everyone.

828
00:46:06.583 --> 00:46:08.542
<i>-Good to see you. boy!</i>
-There they are.

829
00:46:08.625 --> 00:46:11.125
Daddy's on the tee... Wanna
see Daddy drive the ball?

830
00:46:11.208 --> 00:46:14.333
{\an8}Please. dear. Thank you. All
right. boys. This is for you.

831
00:46:17.791 --> 00:46:19.042
Whoa!

832
00:46:19.125 --> 00:46:21.916
Oh! Daddy got a
hold of that one.

833
00:46:22.958 --> 00:46:24.208
What are you doing?

834
00:46:24.291 --> 00:46:27.375
Gordy! You got to see
a doctor about that!

835
00:46:27.458 --> 00:46:28.500
Happy! Happy! Happy!

836
00:46:28.583 --> 00:46:31.583
<i>Entering day two and feeding
off the fans' support.</i>

837
00:46:31.666 --> 00:46:34.833
{\an8}<i>Happy Gilmore has
jumped into the top ten.</i>

838
00:46:34.916 --> 00:46:37.708
Oscar. Where were
you? Who's this?

839
00:46:37.791 --> 00:46:39.917
Oh. he's Esteban. my caddie.

840
00:46:40.000 --> 00:46:40.917
-Okay.
-Steven.

841
00:46:41.000 --> 00:46:42.125
Steven. nice to meet...

842
00:46:42.208 --> 00:46:44.792
No. You don't get a caddie. Caddies
don't get caddies. I'm sorry.

843
00:46:44.875 --> 00:46:46.250
No? Can he play?

844
00:46:46.333 --> 00:46:47.792
What do you mean... He's not...

845
00:46:47.875 --> 00:46:50.500
This is the pro tournament.
I'm sorry. He's gotta go.

846
00:46:55.041 --> 00:46:57.833
Happy Gilmore!
Okay. got it. Okay.

847
00:46:57.916 --> 00:46:59.750
All right. Ciao. <i>Adiós.</i>

848
00:46:59.833 --> 00:47:01.417
He took his hat.

849
00:47:01.500 --> 00:47:03.417
All right. go!

850
00:47:03.500 --> 00:47:07.083
Okay. we got to play. man.
Let me have the driver.

851
00:47:13.875 --> 00:47:17.417
Oh. damn it.

852
00:47:17.500 --> 00:47:20.291
Wait! Please!

853
00:47:21.000 --> 00:47:22.333
Now he gets it.

854
00:47:28.875 --> 00:47:30.125
-Happy! Happy!
-That was the shot.

855
00:47:30.208 --> 00:47:32.792
Daddy! Daddy! Daddy!

856
00:47:32.875 --> 00:47:35.542
{\an8}<i>And heading into
Saturday. two shots back.</i>

857
00:47:35.625 --> 00:47:38.042
{\an8}<i>The comeback kid. Happy Gilmore.</i>

858
00:47:38.125 --> 00:47:41.791
Good shot. Happy!

859
00:47:51.583 --> 00:47:54.708
Happy! Rules!

860
00:47:54.791 --> 00:47:57.083
Happy! Happy!

861
00:47:58.291 --> 00:48:01.500
Guys. what are you doing? I'm
trying to watch your dad play golf!

862
00:48:01.583 --> 00:48:04.333
-Guys. we can't hear!
-Come on. guys.

863
00:48:04.416 --> 00:48:06.708
<i>No one could have
expected this.</i>

864
00:48:06.791 --> 00:48:08.375
<i>Happy Gilmore.</i>

865
00:48:08.458 --> 00:48:11.958
{\an8}From off the couch to the
top of the leader board.

866
00:48:12.041 --> 00:48:14.750
<i>And what was supposed to
be a nostalgic footnote</i>

867
00:48:14.833 --> 00:48:18.917
<i>has turned into one of the best
three rounds anyone has ever seen.</i>

868
00:48:19.000 --> 00:48:22.208
The thing is. if I go for
this and miss the cup.

869
00:48:22.291 --> 00:48:25.042
it's going to roll right
off the green. so... yeah.

870
00:48:25.125 --> 00:48:26.917
-Okay. I see.
-Yeah.

871
00:48:27.000 --> 00:48:28.292
What's a green?

872
00:48:28.375 --> 00:48:31.000
Green? Know what? Don't
worry about that right now.

873
00:48:31.083 --> 00:48:34.083
What I'm looking for is some
positive energy. you know?

874
00:48:34.166 --> 00:48:35.042
Can I help?

875
00:48:35.125 --> 00:48:38.000
Actually. you can. Remember
the happy place I went to?

876
00:48:38.083 --> 00:48:40.208
-Yes.
-You go to yours.

877
00:48:40.958 --> 00:48:42.375
Okay. I'll try.

878
00:48:48.541 --> 00:48:49.541
What's up. man?

879
00:48:50.041 --> 00:48:52.125
What do you got there? Honey?

880
00:48:53.291 --> 00:48:57.333
{\an8}What is this? What is this?

881
00:48:57.416 --> 00:48:59.750
Is this about the
job? Come on...

882
00:49:00.500 --> 00:49:04.416
{\an8}Let's... That's...
Come on. man.

883
00:49:06.250 --> 00:49:10.500
Oh. no. Not a bear. Not a bear.

884
00:49:10.583 --> 00:49:12.875
Goddamn you. busboy!

885
00:49:20.708 --> 00:49:23.083
-I'm happy now. Hit the ball.
-Yeah.

886
00:49:23.166 --> 00:49:24.458
Yes.

887
00:49:24.541 --> 00:49:27.667
You were thinking about a bear
eating that waiter. weren't you?

888
00:49:27.750 --> 00:49:28.625
Yes.

889
00:49:28.708 --> 00:49:32.250
-I thought so. Was there honey involved?
<i>-Un poquito.</i>

890
00:49:32.333 --> 00:49:33.875
I love it.

891
00:49:33.958 --> 00:49:35.208
Come on. Happy.

892
00:49:36.208 --> 00:49:39.666
Come on. Happy.

893
00:49:40.625 --> 00:49:43.083
<i>Oh. no. I don't see
that one stopping.</i>

894
00:49:43.166 --> 00:49:44.750
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

895
00:49:44.833 --> 00:49:47.833
<i>Zalatoris' ball
marker to the rescue!

896
00:49:47.916 --> 00:49:49.708
Yeah. Blondie!

897
00:49:49.791 --> 00:49:51.958
{\an8}<i>And the fairy tale continues.</i>

898
00:49:52.041 --> 00:49:55.750
<i>Happy Gilmore has somehow
turned back the hands of time.</i>

899
00:49:58.375 --> 00:50:00.583
-No. Not again.
-Come here. Come on!

900
00:50:01.875 --> 00:50:03.708
We gotta do it!

901
00:50:03.791 --> 00:50:06.667
Oh!

902
00:50:06.750 --> 00:50:10.917
I love it! Yeah. Oscar! Whoo!

903
00:50:11.000 --> 00:50:13.292
{\an8}<i>Less than two months
after hitting rock bottom</i>

904
00:50:13.375 --> 00:50:15.167
{\an8}<i>in a drunken golf cart crash.</i>

905
00:50:15.250 --> 00:50:20.167
{\an8}<i>Happy Gilmore is 18 holes away
from a seventh gold jacket.</i>

906
00:50:20.250 --> 00:50:22.083
The only possible
conclusion is that

907
00:50:22.166 --> 00:50:25.792
Happy Gilmore has reached
an agreement of some kind

908
00:50:25.875 --> 00:50:29.292
with Satan. a.k.a. the Devil!

909
00:50:29.375 --> 00:50:32.125
All right. Let's go! Happy!

910
00:50:32.208 --> 00:50:33.708
-Good job. Mr. Gilmore.
-What's up?

911
00:50:33.791 --> 00:50:34.958
In the zone today. Man.

912
00:50:35.041 --> 00:50:37.792
We were putting. We were doing
okay. A little luck involved.

913
00:50:37.875 --> 00:50:39.708
Hey. Mr. Gilmore. Billy Jenkins.

914
00:50:39.791 --> 00:50:41.708
-Hey. nice to meet you. Bobby.
-Billy.

915
00:50:41.791 --> 00:50:44.500
Billy was on fire today. I was
like. where did that come from?

916
00:50:44.583 --> 00:50:47.125
Had the best round of my
life. I'm in second place.

917
00:50:47.208 --> 00:50:48.583
You and me play tomorrow.

918
00:50:48.666 --> 00:50:50.167
You're kidding. Look
forward to that.

919
00:50:50.250 --> 00:50:53.000
I've never been in the hunt.
It's a dream come true.

920
00:50:53.083 --> 00:50:55.042
You're going to love it.
You get in the top five.

921
00:50:55.125 --> 00:50:57.750
you get to play against those
buffoons from the new league.

922
00:50:57.833 --> 00:50:59.708
What's up with that tool
starting that league?

923
00:50:59.791 --> 00:51:01.417
The guy came to see
me to talk about it.

924
00:51:01.500 --> 00:51:04.333
He had the worst breath I've
ever smelled in my life.

925
00:51:04.416 --> 00:51:05.750
Like somebody died in his mouth

926
00:51:05.833 --> 00:51:07.958
or a donkey took a shit
there or something...

927
00:51:08.041 --> 00:51:10.083
It was not good. Anyways.
I got to get to a meeting.

928
00:51:10.166 --> 00:51:12.417
Love you. Bubba.
David. good to see you.

929
00:51:12.500 --> 00:51:13.750
It's Billy.

930
00:51:13.833 --> 00:51:19.125
So. in summary. I am no longer
allowed to purchase magic markers

931
00:51:19.208 --> 00:51:20.708
in the state of Connecticut.

932
00:51:20.791 --> 00:51:23.750
I am Nate. and I
am one day sober.

933
00:51:26.916 --> 00:51:30.208
Nate. you're an
example to us all.

934
00:51:30.833 --> 00:51:31.583
What?

935
00:51:31.666 --> 00:51:33.583
Before we finish. I'd
like to say a few words

936
00:51:33.666 --> 00:51:36.083
about the remarkable achievement
of our brother. Happy.

937
00:51:36.166 --> 00:51:39.292
We've been watching you play.
Mr. Gilmore. So inspiring.

938
00:51:39.375 --> 00:51:44.667
Yeah! Happy Gilmore. making
Black people like golf again.

939
00:51:44.750 --> 00:51:46.125
That's right. Bessie.

940
00:51:46.208 --> 00:51:49.375
I just hope Happy's able to
continue to play as well tomorrow.

941
00:51:50.083 --> 00:51:52.791
Tomorrow being of
course... Oh...

942
00:51:54.083 --> 00:51:55.291
Mother's Day.

943
00:51:58.708 --> 00:52:02.208
<i>Welcome to the final round
of the Tour Championship.</i>

944
00:52:02.291 --> 00:52:03.958
<i>Here come your current leaders.</i>

945
00:52:04.041 --> 00:52:05.375
<i>Journeyman Billy Jenkins.</i>

946
00:52:05.458 --> 00:52:09.917
<i>getting his first taste of success
after an undistinguished career.</i>

947
00:52:10.000 --> 00:52:11.583
<i>The only man in his way.</i>

948
00:52:11.666 --> 00:52:16.542
<i>a golf magician named
Happy Octavius Gilmore.</i>

