1184
01:05:50.583 --> 01:05:52.333
This girl's got
some body on her.

1185
01:05:52.416 --> 01:05:56.333
Hey. we do not
objectify women anymore.

1186
01:05:57.625 --> 01:05:58.500
What?

1187
01:05:58.583 --> 01:06:03.250
Okay. great. Uh. looks like the DA
has withdrawn the arrest warrant.

1188
01:06:03.333 --> 01:06:04.208
What?

1189
01:06:04.291 --> 01:06:06.542
Even though you appeared
to some onlookers

1190
01:06:06.625 --> 01:06:08.375
to be inebriated
at the tournament.

1191
01:06:08.458 --> 01:06:10.125
you weren't administered
an alcohol test.

1192
01:06:10.208 --> 01:06:12.125
-And... I have better news.
-Yes?

1193
01:06:12.208 --> 01:06:14.125
You came in sixth
at that tournament.

1194
01:06:14.208 --> 01:06:17.083
That's right. I forgot about
that. How much did I win?

1195
01:06:17.166 --> 01:06:18.833
Uh. $496.000.

1196
01:06:18.916 --> 01:06:20.208
-Oh. my God!
-No way!

1197
01:06:20.291 --> 01:06:21.916
-No! What?
-Holy shit!

1198
01:06:23.000 --> 01:06:24.000
Baby! Yay!

1199
01:06:24.083 --> 01:06:25.750
Now you're really gonna hate me.

1200
01:06:25.833 --> 01:06:30.958
The tour is fining you
$500.000 for bad behavior.

1201
01:06:31.041 --> 01:06:33.875
So he lost $37.000?

1202
01:06:33.958 --> 01:06:35.458
No. It's $33.000. Dad.

1203
01:06:35.541 --> 01:06:38.958
It's $4.000. you buffoons.
How is that good news?

1204
01:06:39.041 --> 01:06:42.250
Well. you came in sixth. but
the winner. Billy Jenkins.

1205
01:06:42.333 --> 01:06:45.750
opted out of the tour team because
he's playing for the bad guys.

1206
01:06:45.833 --> 01:06:47.125
So you made the team.

1207
01:06:47.208 --> 01:06:49.208
-Dad. that's great!
-Whoa! Okay. Pop.

1208
01:06:49.291 --> 01:06:51.542
They don't want
me. I'm a disgrace.

1209
01:06:51.625 --> 01:06:53.208
A freaking embarrassment.

1210
01:06:53.291 --> 01:06:55.250
Let's go outside.
Dad. for a second.

1211
01:06:56.000 --> 01:06:57.000
Next.

1212
01:07:00.625 --> 01:07:04.292
Well. Shooter. due to
Mr. Manatee's sworn statement.

1213
01:07:04.375 --> 01:07:08.500
you are now technically an
escapee from a mental institution.

1214
01:07:08.583 --> 01:07:11.042
Welcome to the club.

1215
01:07:12.916 --> 01:07:15.833
Dad. it doesn't matter if you
play for that team or not.

1216
01:07:15.916 --> 01:07:17.292
You have to stop drinking.

1217
01:07:17.375 --> 01:07:18.458
I did. It's just...

1218
01:07:18.541 --> 01:07:21.167
Just nothing. You gotta
find peace somehow.

1219
01:07:21.250 --> 01:07:23.250
There's no peace. I...

1220
01:07:23.333 --> 01:07:25.083
The reason I joined
that tour again

1221
01:07:25.166 --> 01:07:28.125
was to get you the future you
deserve. and I lost $4.000.

1222
01:07:28.208 --> 01:07:30.958
You think if you made that money
I could leave you like this?

1223
01:07:31.041 --> 01:07:33.458
It's not your job to take
care of me. I told you.

1224
01:07:33.541 --> 01:07:36.208
-Of course it is. We're family.
-You're stuck with us.

1225
01:07:36.291 --> 01:07:37.417
Yeah. come on. Dad.

1226
01:07:37.500 --> 01:07:39.458
I don't want you to
be stuck with me.

1227
01:07:39.541 --> 01:07:41.166
You didn't do nothing
wrong. It's me.

1228
01:07:41.916 --> 01:07:43.791
I think this person could help.

1229
01:07:47.791 --> 01:07:50.875
Hey. you gotta put a
little mustard on that ball

1230
01:07:50.958 --> 01:07:55.208
so it doesn't get stuck where
the pirate hide his. uh. uh...

1231
01:07:55.291 --> 01:07:56.500
booty and shit.

1232
01:07:56.583 --> 01:07:58.083
The hold?

1233
01:07:58.166 --> 01:08:00.875
Yeah. the hold.
Get at it. kiddies.

1234
01:08:00.958 --> 01:08:03.542
-Thank you!
-Are you Slim Peterson?

1235
01:08:03.625 --> 01:08:05.167
That's what they call me.

1236
01:08:05.250 --> 01:08:08.250
Your dad Chubbs was my teacher.
My name's Happy Gilmore...

1237
01:08:08.333 --> 01:08:09.625
I know who you are.

1238
01:08:09.708 --> 01:08:15.292
Hey. you gotta hit it under the octopus
and bank it off one of his leg things.

1239
01:08:15.375 --> 01:08:16.375
The tentacles?

1240
01:08:16.458 --> 01:08:18.625
Yeah. testicles. Now.
what was you saying?

1241
01:08:18.708 --> 01:08:20.917
I need to talk to you
for a few minutes.

1242
01:08:21.000 --> 01:08:23.583
Damn. mosquitoes.
They everywhere.

1243
01:08:23.666 --> 01:08:25.083
-What...
-Look at them.

1244
01:08:26.625 --> 01:08:27.625
Alligator?

1245
01:08:27.708 --> 01:08:30.125
No. vending machine. I
didn't have enough change.

1246
01:08:30.208 --> 01:08:33.166
Had to reach up there to get my
Famous Amos chocolate chip cookies.

1247
01:08:33.750 --> 01:08:37.250
Man. looking at you just
reminded me of what I did to you.

1248
01:08:37.333 --> 01:08:38.500
What'd you do to me?

1249
01:08:38.583 --> 01:08:41.125
What I did to my own
kids. Stole a parent.

1250
01:08:41.208 --> 01:08:43.292
Man. you gotta forgive
yourself for that.

1251
01:08:43.375 --> 01:08:44.500
Don't want to.

1252
01:08:44.583 --> 01:08:46.417
I didn't want to
forgive you either.

1253
01:08:46.500 --> 01:08:48.625
because it was
easier to hate you

1254
01:08:48.708 --> 01:08:51.916
than to deal with the fact that
my daddy wasn't coming back.

1255
01:08:52.583 --> 01:08:56.125
It's kind of like I was
using hate to keep him alive.

1256
01:08:56.208 --> 01:08:59.458
But once I forgave you.
I became myself again.

1257
01:08:59.541 --> 01:09:02.458
And that's who I knew my
daddy wanted me to be.

1258
01:09:05.416 --> 01:09:09.292
You loved your wife.
You loved my dad.

1259
01:09:09.375 --> 01:09:11.292
And they loved you. period.

1260
01:09:11.375 --> 01:09:14.167
You know what else
they loved? Golf.

1261
01:09:14.250 --> 01:09:15.708
Oh. my God. yeah.

1262
01:09:15.791 --> 01:09:17.375
I talked to your little girl.

1263
01:09:17.458 --> 01:09:20.208
and she said you got a chance
to save the whole sport

1264
01:09:20.291 --> 01:09:22.792
by playing against
some clown league?

1265
01:09:22.875 --> 01:09:26.125
Yeah. well. why don't you
go kick some bozo ass then?

1266
01:09:26.208 --> 01:09:27.666
Let's do it for them.

1267
01:09:30.208 --> 01:09:31.917
I am so sorry.

1268
01:09:32.000 --> 01:09:34.167
Boy. why you had to
squeeze it like that?

1269
01:09:34.250 --> 01:09:36.083
I will throw these out. I can...

1270
01:09:36.166 --> 01:09:38.167
Give them here. I got
some Gorilla Glue.

1271
01:09:38.250 --> 01:09:39.667
Yeah. love you. buddy.

1272
01:09:39.750 --> 01:09:41.708
Yeah. man. thank
you for stopping by.

1273
01:09:43.583 --> 01:09:46.167
You know. we could
use some help.

1274
01:09:46.250 --> 01:09:50.875
Oh. about time somebody
recognized my genius. Say less.

1275
01:09:50.958 --> 01:09:52.167
Okay. okay.

1276
01:09:52.250 --> 01:09:53.875
Where do you think
you're going. Slim?

1277
01:09:53.958 --> 01:09:55.958
I'm going to help
save golf. Charley.

1278
01:09:56.041 --> 01:09:59.958
If you leave now. you ain't ever
coming back. you big pork chop.

1279
01:10:00.041 --> 01:10:04.125
Damn straight I ain't never coming
back. you fine-ass English hillbilly.

1280
01:10:04.875 --> 01:10:06.125
Welcome. gentlemen.

1281
01:10:06.208 --> 01:10:09.542
You are the five golfers
who will represent our tour

1282
01:10:09.625 --> 01:10:12.541
in the grudge match
against the Maxi League.

1283
01:10:13.125 --> 01:10:16.292
I don't have to tell you how
important it is that we beat them.

1284
01:10:16.375 --> 01:10:20.666
And here to talk about how we're going
to accomplish that is Shooter McGavin.

1285
01:10:22.083 --> 01:10:24.083
Thank you. Doug. I'll
take it from here.

1286
01:10:25.291 --> 01:10:27.166
I want to talk to
you about pressure.

1287
01:10:27.958 --> 01:10:31.333
Now. as the most successful
golfer of the '90s.

1288
01:10:31.958 --> 01:10:34.583
I've faced my share. believe me.

1289
01:10:34.666 --> 01:10:37.542
but nothing like my
30 years in the can.

1290
01:10:37.625 --> 01:10:41.125
And if I let my guard down
there for a nanosecond...

1291
01:10:41.833 --> 01:10:43.000
Stab!

1292
01:10:43.541 --> 01:10:46.166
I got a shiv in my guts.

1293
01:10:46.916 --> 01:10:49.750
Anyway. I hear you guys all
have ice water in your veins.

1294
01:10:49.833 --> 01:10:53.458
Well. I reviewed the footage
and I ain't seeing it.

1295
01:10:53.541 --> 01:10:55.708
-Man. what's happening right now?
-Uh...

1296
01:10:55.791 --> 01:10:57.000
Bryson DeChambeau.

1297
01:10:58.125 --> 01:11:01.042
{\an8}2022 Portland Open. Eighth hole.

1298
01:11:01.125 --> 01:11:02.750
You got a two-stroke lead.

1299
01:11:02.833 --> 01:11:06.125
You got an opportunity
to pull way ahead and...

1300
01:11:07.333 --> 01:11:08.833
-Aw!
-What?

1301
01:11:10.458 --> 01:11:11.583
Huh?

1302
01:11:12.541 --> 01:11:13.791
Oops.

1303
01:11:14.500 --> 01:11:16.792
Come on. We all miss a
putt every now and then.

1304
01:11:16.875 --> 01:11:18.750
Scottie Scheffler.

1305
01:11:19.708 --> 01:11:20.542
Oh. boy.

1306
01:11:20.625 --> 01:11:22.875
2019 Cadillac Invitational.

1307
01:11:22.958 --> 01:11:25.333
Third hole. You're tied.
Top of the leader board.

1308
01:11:25.416 --> 01:11:28.625
It's Sunday. Pressure's
on. And you...

1309
01:11:32.166 --> 01:11:33.541
Hmm. Into the woods.

1310
01:11:34.291 --> 01:11:37.125
The woods. Scottie?
Are you afraid to win?

1311
01:11:37.208 --> 01:11:39.250
-What about you?
-What?

1312
01:11:39.333 --> 01:11:42.667
Yeah. 1996 Tour
Championship. Final round.

1313
01:11:42.750 --> 01:11:43.708
Don't do it. boys.

1314
01:11:43.791 --> 01:11:45.500
No. This isn't relevant.

1315
01:11:45.583 --> 01:11:47.417
Four-stroke lead
on the back nine?

1316
01:11:47.500 --> 01:11:49.792
The guy who beat you
got hit by a Volkswagen.

1317
01:11:49.875 --> 01:11:50.833
-Jackass!
-Jackass!

1318
01:11:50.916 --> 01:11:55.292
All right! Maybe I haven't handled
the pressure perfectly myself.

1319
01:11:55.375 --> 01:11:58.292
but I have seen the surgically
modified freaks that you're playing.

1320
01:11:58.375 --> 01:12:01.500
I have seen the monstrosity
they're making you play on.

1321
01:12:01.583 --> 01:12:07.291
And if you can't take the heat.
golf. as we know it. it's finished!

1322
01:12:09.583 --> 01:12:11.083
So let's do this!

1323
01:12:11.166 --> 01:12:12.875
Come on. Let's put them in.

1324
01:12:12.958 --> 01:12:13.958
All right. On three.

1325
01:12:14.041 --> 01:12:15.881
-One. two. three... Shooter!
-Golf!

1326
01:12:21.291 --> 01:12:23.417
Time to prepare for
a moving target.

1327
01:12:23.500 --> 01:12:24.792
The cups are gonna be moving?

1328
01:12:24.875 --> 01:12:27.208
Damn it. Rory. Nothing's
off-limits for these commies.

1329
01:12:27.291 --> 01:12:29.333
-Now. Oscar's cousin...
-Esteban.

1330
01:12:29.416 --> 01:12:33.542
Esteban is fast. And
elusive. I'm told.

1331
01:12:33.625 --> 01:12:35.125
He's gonna start
at the red flag.

1332
01:12:35.208 --> 01:12:38.625
If he makes it to the blue
flag. we haven't done our jobs.

1333
01:12:38.708 --> 01:12:40.208
He's cool with us hitting him?

1334
01:12:40.291 --> 01:12:41.375
Yeah. He's been paid.

1335
01:12:41.458 --> 01:12:44.708
What did he say?

1336
01:12:44.791 --> 01:12:46.292
You're never gonna hit him.

1337
01:12:46.375 --> 01:12:47.500
Oh. yeah? How come?

1338
01:12:47.583 --> 01:12:49.417
I'm shifty!

1339
01:12:49.500 --> 01:12:51.792
Okay. he's shifty.
He is. I've seen it.

1340
01:12:53.833 --> 01:12:55.667
<i>♪ Get your biscuits
in the kitchen ♪</i>

1341
01:12:55.750 --> 01:12:57.208
<i>♪ I'm a sous chef on a mission ♪</i>

1342
01:12:57.291 --> 01:12:59.292
<i>♪ Baby. wiggle
it. it's vicious ♪</i>

1343
01:12:59.375 --> 01:13:01.417
<i>♪ We about to break the dishes ♪</i>

1344
01:13:01.500 --> 01:13:03.500
<i>♪ Got the pepper
with the sodium ♪</i>

1345
01:13:03.583 --> 01:13:06.583
<i>♪ We cookin' with petroleum
Come step up to the podium ♪</i>

1346
01:13:06.666 --> 01:13:07.583
It's too easy!

1347
01:13:07.666 --> 01:13:08.792
<i>♪ And cut up this linoleum ♪</i>

1348
01:13:10.791 --> 01:13:12.125
Yeah!

1349
01:13:12.750 --> 01:13:13.750
You got me!

1350
01:13:14.333 --> 01:13:16.375
Come on. cousin.
You're almost there.

1351
01:13:28.500 --> 01:13:30.625
Okay. stop! We got
him. We got him.

1352
01:13:33.458 --> 01:13:34.958
I said stop! Who did that?

1353
01:13:38.083 --> 01:13:40.791
Oscar. You sicko.

1354
01:13:41.791 --> 01:13:43.542
-So I got a hockey question for you.
-Uh-huh.

1355
01:13:43.625 --> 01:13:45.458
I notice when the players fight.

1356
01:13:45.541 --> 01:13:48.542
one of the guys is always pulling the
jersey over the head of the other guy

1357
01:13:48.625 --> 01:13:50.292
-before he starts pounding on him.
-Right.

1358
01:13:50.375 --> 01:13:51.333
-Yeah.
-Is that hard?

1359
01:13:51.416 --> 01:13:54.333
-No. it's easy. You want me to show you?
-Yes. please.

1360
01:13:54.416 --> 01:13:56.458
Brother. Can I borrow
you for a second?

1361
01:13:56.541 --> 01:13:58.833
Basically all you do
is pull the shirt over.

1362
01:13:58.916 --> 01:14:00.792
This traps the arms. You know?

1363
01:14:00.875 --> 01:14:02.417
-Yeah.
-Knockout. Money.

1364
01:14:02.500 --> 01:14:03.667
-You sure?
-Yeah.

1365
01:14:03.750 --> 01:14:05.250
Okay. How much?

1366
01:14:05.333 --> 01:14:06.583
Fifty.

1367
01:14:06.666 --> 01:14:09.875
Uh. I'll give you a hundred.
Here we go. You know what I mean?

1368
01:14:09.958 --> 01:14:11.000
Yeah. That was nice.

1369
01:14:11.083 --> 01:14:13.708
-Okay. Money.
-Okay. You got it. Scottie. I'm broke.

1370
01:14:13.791 --> 01:14:15.375
-Thank you.
-There you go. Okay.

1371
01:14:15.458 --> 01:14:17.083
Great job. today. by the way.

1372
01:14:17.166 --> 01:14:19.583
-Excellent. Yeah. it's fun.
-Yeah. That was easy.

1373
01:14:19.666 --> 01:14:21.167
I love my job.

1374
01:14:21.250 --> 01:14:25.917
Mini-golf-style putting is about
two things. angles and obstacles.

1375
01:14:26.000 --> 01:14:29.917
If you can read the angles.
you can avoid the obstacles.

1376
01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:32.958
Let's putt so we can
figure those angles out.

1377
01:14:34.041 --> 01:14:35.666
Yes! Scheffler!

1378
01:14:38.291 --> 01:14:40.250
Yeah. you're right.

1379
01:14:40.333 --> 01:14:44.833
One more day before we face these
chumps. This is how I used to toughen up.

1380
01:14:52.333 --> 01:14:55.167
Oh. my God. Rory!

1381
01:14:55.250 --> 01:14:57.250
Okay. Oscar. let's
see your stuff.

1382
01:15:11.416 --> 01:15:15.416
<i>♪ Sittin' down is stupid
Now let me see you move it ♪</i>

1383
01:15:16.208 --> 01:15:19.375
Oh! Do you want bread sticks?

1384
01:15:24.125 --> 01:15:26.625
A batting cage to toughen up?

1385
01:15:26.708 --> 01:15:29.167
I love how much
we're in your head.

1386
01:15:29.250 --> 01:15:31.292
Oh. I think we're in
your head. Brendan.

1387
01:15:31.375 --> 01:15:34.125
Otherwise. you wouldn't be
snooping around and following us.

1388
01:15:34.208 --> 01:15:35.208
My name is Billy.

1389
01:15:35.291 --> 01:15:36.500
Hey. settle down. Barry.

1390
01:15:36.583 --> 01:15:38.875
and get off the electric
Royce. No leaning.

1391
01:15:39.583 --> 01:15:42.708
Look. Happy. I don't want to
have to humiliate you tomorrow.

1392
01:15:43.833 --> 01:15:45.750
You're in the DNA of my league.

1393
01:15:45.833 --> 01:15:47.958
The way you rebelled
against the traditions

1394
01:15:48.041 --> 01:15:50.208
and fussiness of golf.
it was beautiful.

1395
01:15:50.291 --> 01:15:52.917
So I'm gonna offer you one last
chance to be a part of it. okay?

1396
01:15:53.000 --> 01:15:53.833
Hell no.

1397
01:15:53.916 --> 01:15:57.375
And you look like Freddy Krueger
worked at Starbucks. Change it.

1398
01:15:58.041 --> 01:15:59.583
I'll give you 10%
of the company.

1399
01:16:01.833 --> 01:16:04.875
I can't believe I'm the one
sticking up for tradition. but...

1400
01:16:04.958 --> 01:16:08.750
My wife liked the way
golf was played. as is.

1401
01:16:08.833 --> 01:16:11.250
And she was pretty much
right about everything.

1402
01:16:11.833 --> 01:16:15.708
So sorry. boys. but tomorrow.
your dumb league is done.

1403
01:16:15.791 --> 01:16:18.708
No. tomorrow. I'm gonna finish
the revolution you started.

1404
01:16:18.791 --> 01:16:20.917
I heard what you said about
my breath to Bubba Watson.

1405
01:16:21.000 --> 01:16:23.583
I have gingivitis.
It's hereditary. okay?

1406
01:16:23.666 --> 01:16:27.083
And I got it from my
great-grandfather. So I'm so sorry.

1407
01:16:27.166 --> 01:16:29.500
I'm literally
smelling it from here.

1408
01:16:29.583 --> 01:16:31.292
And the wind is
blowing that way.

1409
01:16:31.375 --> 01:16:34.125
Something has to change in
your life. I'm telling you.

1410
01:16:55.333 --> 01:16:56.333
Okay.

1411
01:16:57.458 --> 01:16:58.792
Come here. Bring it in.

1412
01:16:58.875 --> 01:17:01.750
I just wanted to say thank you guys
for always getting me back on track.

1413
01:17:01.833 --> 01:17:03.208
-I love you.
-Love you.

1414
01:17:03.291 --> 01:17:06.667
This ain't about Vivi going to dance
school. It's about saving golf?

1415
01:17:06.750 --> 01:17:08.167
Maybe we can do both.

1416
01:17:08.250 --> 01:17:10.292
but we will figure
that out. I promise.

