1650
01:29:22.041 --> 01:29:25.708
<i>The future of regular
golf hangs in the balance.</i>

1651
01:29:25.791 --> 01:29:28.917
Thousand-yard par four.
That's a little long.

1652
01:29:29.000 --> 01:29:30.541
Not for me. big man.

1653
01:29:32.708 --> 01:29:34.458
Yeah. Check this out.

1654
01:29:42.333 --> 01:29:43.458
Hello?

1655
01:29:43.541 --> 01:29:47.125
Woo-woo!

1656
01:29:53.625 --> 01:29:56.375
<i>Whoa!</i>

1657
01:29:56.458 --> 01:30:01.042
That is the longest
drive I have ever seen.

1658
01:30:01.125 --> 01:30:04.541
Hey. you remember
my name now? Bitch.

1659
01:30:05.958 --> 01:30:07.958
I'd like to forget ever
seeing that hip thing.

1660
01:30:08.041 --> 01:30:09.208
That was disgusting.

1661
01:30:09.291 --> 01:30:11.458
<i>Jenkins can be on
the green in two.</i>

1662
01:30:11.541 --> 01:30:15.917
<i>while Gilmore has no hope of getting
on in less than three strokes.</i>

1663
01:30:16.000 --> 01:30:17.583
Verne. that sucks.

1664
01:30:20.000 --> 01:30:22.500
Okay to use that hate
one last time. Slim?

1665
01:30:22.583 --> 01:30:24.708
Yeah. let it all out.

1666
01:30:31.041 --> 01:30:32.666
Ain't no surgery for that.

1667
01:30:36.000 --> 01:30:37.750
Come on. Happy. let's go.

1668
01:30:39.666 --> 01:30:43.583
You never made the Bruins
because you suck at skating.

1669
01:30:43.666 --> 01:30:46.042
You shut your stupid face.

1670
01:30:46.125 --> 01:30:47.292
Who's he talking to?

1671
01:30:47.375 --> 01:30:50.042
Oh! And your daughter's
never going to ballet school

1672
01:30:50.125 --> 01:30:52.208
because her dad's
a washed up drunk.

1673
01:30:52.291 --> 01:30:54.125
I'm gonna kill you!

1674
01:30:58.500 --> 01:30:59.583
Uh-oh.

1675
01:31:23.291 --> 01:31:25.750
Somebody went further.

1676
01:31:25.833 --> 01:31:27.333
Yeah...

1677
01:31:27.416 --> 01:31:30.500
Bitch!

1678
01:31:34.458 --> 01:31:36.083
<i>Jenkins is first to hit.</i>

1679
01:31:42.666 --> 01:31:44.166
Yes!

1680
01:31:45.916 --> 01:31:49.833
Oh. and by the way. all
four of your boys are dumb!

1681
01:31:49.916 --> 01:31:51.500
What did you say?

1682
01:31:52.583 --> 01:31:56.375
-Ow! Ooh!
-Aw.

1683
01:31:56.458 --> 01:31:58.083
Yeah!

1684
01:31:58.666 --> 01:32:01.500
<i>I can't believe there's
taxis without drivers.</i>

1685
01:32:01.583 --> 01:32:06.917
<i>AI girlfriends. and now. quite
possibly. the end of traditional golf.</i>

1686
01:32:12.250 --> 01:32:13.167
I'll go first.

1687
01:32:13.250 --> 01:32:16.041
Give you a chance to think about
how you're going to play that.

1688
01:32:17.375 --> 01:32:19.083
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

1689
01:32:20.375 --> 01:32:23.292
Billy Jenkins. you stepped
on it and stepped in it.

1690
01:32:23.375 --> 01:32:25.333
Shut up. Edward Woodenhand.

1691
01:32:25.416 --> 01:32:28.916
Screw you. Cabbage Patch Kid.

1692
01:32:37.083 --> 01:32:38.583
Take your time.

1693
01:32:38.666 --> 01:32:40.458
Go get my lob wedge. Wait.

1694
01:32:43.291 --> 01:32:44.458
Go stand right there.

1695
01:32:52.833 --> 01:32:53.833
Okay.

1696
01:32:55.166 --> 01:32:56.708
Right in the back of the cup.

1697
01:32:59.541 --> 01:33:03.000
{\an8}-No. don't get off! God!
-Oh!

1698
01:33:03.083 --> 01:33:04.250
{\an8}-Vecsey!
-What?

1699
01:33:04.333 --> 01:33:05.750
God damn it.

1700
01:33:06.375 --> 01:33:08.208
Excuse me. Know
what? You're fired.

1701
01:33:08.291 --> 01:33:09.458
Makes sense.

1702
01:33:09.541 --> 01:33:12.417
Will you quit messing this
up and make this? Come on.

1703
01:33:12.500 --> 01:33:14.125
I'm trying. sir.

1704
01:33:14.208 --> 01:33:15.750
Just get it on the right line.

1705
01:33:15.833 --> 01:33:17.458
Coming right up. sir.

1706
01:33:27.875 --> 01:33:32.292
<i>And Billy Jenkins
is in for four.</i>

1707
01:33:32.375 --> 01:33:34.166
-Yeah!
-Choke on that one. Happy!

1708
01:33:34.833 --> 01:33:39.167
<i>Gilmore has only two shots
left to even tie this thing.</i>

1709
01:33:39.250 --> 01:33:43.625
<i>I'm not even playing and my palms
are sweaty. Mom's spaghetti.</i>

1710
01:33:44.333 --> 01:33:46.167
I can't get a damn
swing off here.

1711
01:33:46.250 --> 01:33:48.458
You got any ideas?
We're in trouble. dude.

1712
01:33:48.541 --> 01:33:51.666
Hmm. I say ricochet that shit.

1713
01:33:53.208 --> 01:33:54.500
Yeah. that's a good idea.

1714
01:34:02.125 --> 01:34:04.583
Amazing!

1715
01:34:04.666 --> 01:34:05.625
Did it go in?

1716
01:34:05.708 --> 01:34:07.250
Not that amazing.

1717
01:34:08.916 --> 01:34:10.208
You nervous?

1718
01:34:10.291 --> 01:34:13.417
No. just... Can I
use your mailbox?

1719
01:34:13.500 --> 01:34:15.208
<i>The question now is.</i>

1720
01:34:15.291 --> 01:34:17.958
<i>how do you hit on a
green you can't stand on?</i>

1721
01:34:18.833 --> 01:34:19.833
What do I do?

1722
01:34:20.458 --> 01:34:21.833
Here we go. Dad!

1723
01:34:21.916 --> 01:34:23.958
-Dad. let's go!
-Let's go! All you!

1724
01:34:24.041 --> 01:34:25.542
-Right now!
-All right.

1725
01:34:25.625 --> 01:34:26.750
What's the plan?

1726
01:34:27.500 --> 01:34:28.667
How about this?

1727
01:34:28.750 --> 01:34:30.750
Go to the other side
directly across from me.

1728
01:34:30.833 --> 01:34:32.292
-Yes. sir.
-Okay.

1729
01:34:32.375 --> 01:34:34.500
-Oscar. Hey.
-Yeah. go!

1730
01:34:34.583 --> 01:34:36.792
Oh. God. I can't bear to watch.

1731
01:34:36.875 --> 01:34:39.333
Oscar. how much do you weigh?

1732
01:34:40.083 --> 01:34:41.458
170.

1733
01:34:42.333 --> 01:34:43.833
Pick up the bag. please.

1734
01:34:45.208 --> 01:34:46.917
Actually. take two clubs out.

1735
01:34:47.000 --> 01:34:49.375
Two clubs. Two. Two clubs.

1736
01:34:49.458 --> 01:34:51.625
Okay. Pick the bag up again.

1737
01:34:52.666 --> 01:34:55.417
And on the count of three.
we're stepping on the green.

1738
01:34:55.500 --> 01:34:57.542
-Okay.
-Are you ready?

1739
01:34:57.625 --> 01:35:03.166
And one. two... three!

1740
01:35:04.208 --> 01:35:05.375
Whoa. oh... Hey...

1741
01:35:06.500 --> 01:35:09.250
That's it. That's it. Okay.
we're gonna hop forward.

1742
01:35:09.333 --> 01:35:12.375
One. Two. Three.

1743
01:35:12.458 --> 01:35:15.250
Ooh.

1744
01:35:17.291 --> 01:35:18.416
<i>Okay.</i>

1745
01:35:20.083 --> 01:35:21.250
<i>Now to the left.</i>

1746
01:35:22.000 --> 01:35:24.166
One. two. three.

1747
01:35:25.375 --> 01:35:26.750
That's it.

1748
01:35:26.833 --> 01:35:30.416
Now we're gonna go
sideways... Two. three.

1749
01:35:33.166 --> 01:35:35.917
Ooh. Oscar... Nice work.

1750
01:35:36.000 --> 01:35:37.583
Check this out.

1751
01:35:38.166 --> 01:35:39.166
Whoa!

1752
01:35:40.541 --> 01:35:42.542
-What's happening?
-What the...

1753
01:35:42.625 --> 01:35:46.292
Sorry. Happy. I had to. We
don't do tiebreakers at Maxi.

1754
01:35:46.375 --> 01:35:48.083
How about we raise the stakes?

1755
01:35:48.166 --> 01:35:50.458
I end this whole project
if you sink this putt.

1756
01:35:50.541 --> 01:35:51.875
And if I miss?

1757
01:35:51.958 --> 01:35:54.083
It's simple. You
join Maxi League.

1758
01:35:59.708 --> 01:36:01.250
How about this?

1759
01:36:01.333 --> 01:36:03.042
You pay for my
daughter's dance school.

1760
01:36:03.125 --> 01:36:04.542
buy me my grandma's house back.

1761
01:36:04.625 --> 01:36:06.625
plus I get your Rolls-Royce.

1762
01:36:07.375 --> 01:36:10.125
plus you gotta buy Oscar
his own restaurant.

1763
01:36:11.041 --> 01:36:12.750
What kind of restaurant
are we talking here?

1764
01:36:12.833 --> 01:36:14.375
What kind of food. Oscar?

1765
01:36:14.458 --> 01:36:16.833
Sushi. No. no. no. Italian.

1766
01:36:16.916 --> 01:36:18.792
Fine. You're on.

1767
01:36:18.875 --> 01:36:21.875
<i>You heard it. There'll
be no playoff today.</i>

1768
01:36:22.958 --> 01:36:24.125
Oscar. I have bad news.

1769
01:36:25.416 --> 01:36:27.333
I'm holding a sand
wedge. I need a putter.

1770
01:36:29.000 --> 01:36:31.166
Just take it slowly
out of the bag.

1771
01:36:32.500 --> 01:36:36.375
That's it. That's it.
Take the sock off.

1772
01:36:36.458 --> 01:36:39.417
Okay. so we're gonna throw it to
each other on the count of three.

1773
01:36:39.500 --> 01:36:40.875
-Okay.
-We can do this.

1774
01:36:42.166 --> 01:36:45.291
One. two. three.

1775
01:36:46.041 --> 01:36:49.750
-Oh!
-Okay. I caught my own club.

1776
01:36:50.708 --> 01:36:52.708
Physics is a bitch. isn't it?

1777
01:36:53.541 --> 01:36:54.917
Here's what we're gonna do.

1778
01:36:55.000 --> 01:36:57.375
We're gonna throw it
straight up in the sky.

1779
01:36:57.458 --> 01:36:58.500
Let's do this.

1780
01:36:58.583 --> 01:37:00.375
Do not get sick. Oscar.

1781
01:37:00.458 --> 01:37:05.708
-Okay. One. two. three.
-One. two...

1782
01:37:10.291 --> 01:37:11.083
Yes!

1783
01:37:11.166 --> 01:37:13.750
Let's go! Let's go. Hap!

1784
01:37:13.833 --> 01:37:16.708
High five. High...

1785
01:37:18.083 --> 01:37:21.666
Hey. Gilmore can do this.
I've seen it. I lived it.

1786
01:37:22.458 --> 01:37:25.708
{\an8}Wow. Cool. How bout we
take this to the Maxi?

1787
01:37:29.708 --> 01:37:31.208
He's gonna fly off.

1788
01:37:31.291 --> 01:37:33.750
-...spot. focus on the spot.
-You got it. Focus.

1789
01:37:34.916 --> 01:37:36.083
Oh. no.

1790
01:37:36.166 --> 01:37:38.083
Hang in there. Oscar. please.

1791
01:37:43.000 --> 01:37:45.542
Come on. Dad. You got it.

1792
01:37:45.625 --> 01:37:47.333
Dad!

1793
01:37:51.541 --> 01:37:53.458
Come on. Dad!

1794
01:37:56.125 --> 01:37:59.041
I love you so much!

1795
01:38:04.875 --> 01:38:09.708
Do it like my daddy taught
you. Tap it. Tap it in.

1796
01:38:19.333 --> 01:38:21.041
<i>It's got a chance.</i>

1797
01:38:22.166 --> 01:38:24.000
-Go.
-Go.

1798
01:38:24.083 --> 01:38:25.625
Come on. Happy.

1799
01:38:25.708 --> 01:38:28.041
-Come on. come on...
-Come on. come on. come on...

1800
01:38:33.416 --> 01:38:37.333
-Get there!
-Oh!

1801
01:38:37.416 --> 01:38:39.583
<i>Oh. no!</i>

1802
01:38:40.791 --> 01:38:44.458
Yes! Welcome to
Maxi. Happy. Whoo!

1803
01:38:53.083 --> 01:38:58.125
Oh. my God! Happy
Gilmore has won!

1804
01:38:59.000 --> 01:39:02.208
<i>And regular golf will live on.</i>

1805
01:39:03.583 --> 01:39:07.042
-I'm 8 Ball! I'm 8 Ball!
-No! That doesn't happen!

1806
01:39:07.125 --> 01:39:09.083
You are a piece of
shit. you know that?

1807
01:39:09.166 --> 01:39:10.583
I did everything I could...

1808
01:39:10.666 --> 01:39:14.042
Oscar! We did it. Oscar!

1809
01:39:18.250 --> 01:39:20.666
<i>Papi. papi.</i> Wake up.

1810
01:39:21.333 --> 01:39:22.375
-Good job!
-Did we win?

1811
01:39:25.083 --> 01:39:26.458
-Yes!
-All right!

1812
01:39:26.541 --> 01:39:27.583
Happy. yes!

1813
01:39:27.666 --> 01:39:29.333
Yeah. yeah!

1814
01:39:29.416 --> 01:39:30.500
Stop.

1815
01:39:33.916 --> 01:39:37.875
Your training paid off. You did it.
I'm proud of you. I'm proud of you.

1816
01:39:37.958 --> 01:39:39.125
-Yes!
-Yes!

1817
01:39:41.041 --> 01:39:43.041
What a great win.
Let's go to Hooters.

1818
01:39:50.875 --> 01:39:54.333
-Happy Gilmore! Happy Gilmore!
-Happy Gilmore! Happy Gilmore!

1819
01:39:54.416 --> 01:39:57.542
I can't believe I'm saying
this. but you're all free to go.

1820
01:39:57.625 --> 01:40:00.250
Beautiful.

1821
01:40:01.875 --> 01:40:04.750
Unbelievable. Tremendous.

1822
01:40:04.833 --> 01:40:06.458
I understand you
have a restaurant.

1823
01:40:06.541 --> 01:40:11.250
{\an8}We have the best Italian Dominican Puerto
Rican Cuban restaurant in the town.

1824
01:40:11.333 --> 01:40:13.167
I love my new job!

1825
01:40:13.250 --> 01:40:16.042
We did it. baby!
We did it for Mom!

1826
01:40:25.125 --> 01:40:29.041
Well. I've won a lot of trophies
and jackets over the years.

1827
01:40:29.833 --> 01:40:35.291
but out of all of them. I have to
say this is by far the most special.

1828
01:40:36.333 --> 01:40:38.583
And I want to thank all
my friends out there

1829
01:40:38.666 --> 01:40:42.291
who helped me achieve
this monumental moment.

1830
01:40:45.125 --> 01:40:46.375
Three months sober.

1831
01:40:46.958 --> 01:40:49.375
Yay! Way to go. Mr. Gilmore!

1832
01:40:50.291 --> 01:40:52.833
Splendid! Splendid. Mr. Gilmore.

1833
01:40:53.750 --> 01:40:56.417
But will you make it to a year?

1834
01:40:56.500 --> 01:41:01.458
-Magic 8-Ball says... unlikely.
-Uh-huh.

1835
01:41:01.541 --> 01:41:05.458
What are you talking about. Hal? Happy's
going to make it a full lifetime.

1836
01:41:05.541 --> 01:41:07.250
Know what else is
full. Charlotte?

1837
01:41:07.333 --> 01:41:10.958
My gutters. Full of dead
leaves and squirrel droppings.

1838
01:41:11.041 --> 01:41:12.833
But you'll be cleaning
them out this weekend.

1839
01:41:12.916 --> 01:41:15.042
I don't like the way
you talk to that kid.

1840
01:41:15.125 --> 01:41:16.292
It's fine. Mr. Gilmore.

1841
01:41:16.375 --> 01:41:19.667
No. it's not fine. That kid has
helped me more than you have. Hal.

1842
01:41:19.750 --> 01:41:21.875
Seriously. Mr. Gilmore.
I got this.

1843
01:41:21.958 --> 01:41:24.542
Guys. can we be done
here? We've got enough.

1844
01:41:24.625 --> 01:41:27.375
Why are you talking into
your collar? Are you high?

1845
01:41:28.791 --> 01:41:30.000
Are you high?

1846
01:41:31.583 --> 01:41:32.958
-Holy...
-Whoa!

1847
01:41:33.041 --> 01:41:34.833
Hallowicious Lieberman!

1848
01:41:34.916 --> 01:41:36.917
You're under arrest for
fraud and extortion.

1849
01:41:37.000 --> 01:41:39.500
We got enough footage of you
being a sick son of a bitch

1850
01:41:39.583 --> 01:41:41.416
to lock you away for a lifetime.

1851
01:41:42.291 --> 01:41:44.000
You narc'd on me?

1852
01:41:44.625 --> 01:41:45.458
Guess so.

1853
01:41:45.541 --> 01:41:47.958
Hey. man. I was just trying
to help these people.

1854
01:41:48.041 --> 01:41:51.208
Manual labor's
therapeutically beneficial.

1855
01:41:51.291 --> 01:41:52.708
-Hey. Happy.
-What?

1856
01:41:52.791 --> 01:41:55.042
-Catch.
-Oh!

1857
01:41:56.125 --> 01:41:59.292
-I believe that's Mr. Gilmore's!
-He got my coin!

1858
01:41:59.375 --> 01:42:03.583
I got the coin!

1859
01:42:09.625 --> 01:42:11.958
-Oh. shit! Stop!
-Stay still!

1860
01:42:13.875 --> 01:42:15.458
You're a very cool kid.

1861
01:42:16.041 --> 01:42:19.250
You're a very cool guy.
You remind me of my dad.

1862
01:42:19.333 --> 01:42:20.333
Yeah?

1863
01:42:27.541 --> 01:42:29.167
All right. just
have fun in Paris.

1864
01:42:29.250 --> 01:42:31.208
If you get homesick for America.

1865
01:42:31.291 --> 01:42:34.375
I can ship over some
Yodels or bottle rockets.

1866
01:42:34.458 --> 01:42:35.667
Whatever you guys want.

1867
01:42:35.750 --> 01:42:38.333
We'll be fine. Dad. And we'll
see you next month. right?

1868
01:42:38.416 --> 01:42:39.250
That's right.

1869
01:42:39.333 --> 01:42:42.250
I got the British Open. I'll show
up a week early. we'll hang out.

1870
01:42:42.333 --> 01:42:44.708
I want to see some fancy
French dancing from this kid.

1871
01:42:44.791 --> 01:42:46.292
Then you can come
check out our show.

1872
01:42:46.375 --> 01:42:47.375
What show?

1873
01:42:47.458 --> 01:42:48.958
We're gonna be singing mimes.

1874
01:42:49.041 --> 01:42:50.792
I thought mimes aren't
allowed to talk.

1875
01:42:50.875 --> 01:42:53.917
That's how we're gonna separate ourselves
from the other mimes. by singing.

1876
01:42:54.000 --> 01:42:55.042
Okay.

1877
01:42:55.125 --> 01:43:00.375
<i>♪ We're trapped in a box! Now
we're tugging on a rope! ♪</i>

1878
01:43:01.125 --> 01:43:03.167
<i>♪ Even look at our sister... ♪</i>

1879
01:43:03.250 --> 01:43:05.333
-And we'll kill you!
-And we'll crush you!

1880
01:43:05.416 --> 01:43:07.417
-I'll murder you!
-Don't you look at her!

1881
01:43:07.500 --> 01:43:10.000
-Smart. I love that!
-Nailed it. Really good.

1882
01:43:10.083 --> 01:43:11.542
Come here. Gonna miss you.

1883
01:43:11.625 --> 01:43:14.792
And if you're hungry on the flight.
enjoy the bread from Oscar's restaurant.

1884
01:43:14.875 --> 01:43:17.333
Go crush them over there
for Mom. Have a ball.

1885
01:43:17.416 --> 01:43:18.250
Love you. Dad.

1886
01:43:18.333 --> 01:43:20.417
-Hey. here you go.
-You're the best. guys.

1887
01:43:20.500 --> 01:43:22.458
-Sir. right there.
-There you go. buddy.

1888
01:43:22.541 --> 01:43:24.958
Yeah. get him!

1889
01:43:25.041 --> 01:43:26.292
I'm so sorry. sweetheart.

1890
01:43:26.375 --> 01:43:27.666
Come on. Vienna.

1891
01:43:29.583 --> 01:43:31.291
